OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fisolated light showers possible. Cloud
OL,7,Fdevelops with showers becoming
OL,8,Fwidespread through the morning and
OL,9,Fafternoon. These will be mostly light
OL,10,Fbut the odd heavier burst is possible.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMainly clear and dry through
OL,14,Fthe evening. Cloud builds after sunset
OL,15,Fwith some patchy light rain at times
OL,16,Fovernight and into Thursday morning.
OL,17,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
