OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA wet and cloudy start to
OL,6,Fthe day, this clears slowly through
OL,7,Fthe morning to leave a dry and partly
OL,8,Fcloudy afternoon for most. Fresh
OL,9,Fwinds. Temperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,12,Funsettled to start the period with
OL,13,Ffurther light rain and blustery winds
OL,14,Fthrough Friday and into Saturday.
OL,15,FTurning drier and brighter on Sunday.
OL,16,FTemperatures becoming above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
